#complexcausality  |  focuses on analyzing the structure of causal relations (e.g., feedback loops, causal chains) leading to the outcome, which could be used to complement the analysis of emergence.
#levelsofanalysis  |  describes the interaction between multiple levels (back and forth) to understand a system. An emergent property is when lower level interactions and properties create emergence at a higher level.
